; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\伊勢→夏菜.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\夏菜泣き声.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "255"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\電話ボックス2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\電話ボックス1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hello!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hello!? <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
"Hey! Where are you right now!? Are you all right!?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Daddy<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>, what happened? Calm down and tell me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">killed a lot of people..."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Code_of_Honor_#2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey... why didn't you tell me sooner...?"</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE>! Turn on the TV! Any channel that's showing the news!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\電話ボックス2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I don't even... have the strength to stand up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That urge to kill is gone too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What I've done feels unreal―as if I were talking in a dream.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Is there any meaning in talking in a dream?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In a limpness that raises questions like that, it's all I can do to hold the receiver.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">What I hear from the other end of the line is a tense voice coming from the TV.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I listen to it in a daze.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Though I already know more or less what it's saying.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">―Er, we go live to the scene.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">About 30 minutes ago, at around 8:50 p.m., on the platform of Motoki Station in Motoki-cho, Sawa Prefecture, an incident occurred in which several women suddenly began killing one another.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Er... there appear to be many witnesses; when the express train bound for Megasawa Station arrived, more than 10 women suddenly began killing one another, an incident without precedent.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\電話ボックス1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"There was one in Motoki-cho too... Someone with the same ability as </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I ran into </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that person</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, where are you right now!? I'll come get you right away!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why didn't you tell me...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If you get the blood of someone with precognition on you, everyone goes crazy, don't they?"</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE>! Where are you!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Goodbye, </STYLE>Daddy<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\publictelephone-receiver2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<STYLE ID="3">I hang up and sink down, drained, inside a phone booth I couldn't say where.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Covered in blood like this, I can't get on a train.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I can't hitchhike either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Before any of that, there's no place for me to go back to.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\電話ボックス2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">When I cut </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that person</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, whose face and name I didn't know, an indescribable pleasure ran through me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even the tips of my hair and nails, which have no nerves, trembled with joy at that pleasure.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And the instant </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that person's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> blood splashed onto someone else, I immediately sensed a different threat.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I ran―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If I'd stayed, I'd surely have been killed too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Killed by women cursed with green eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">However strong I am, a pack of beasts that have lost their reason is extremely dangerous.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That's why I ran.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">What did I come all this way for?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―I came because I was scared I'd want to kill her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―if I'd had the courage to face her―it would never have come to this...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I... what have I been doing?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">What is this feeling inside me right now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Regret, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">fear, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">anxiety, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">loneliness, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">unease, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">anger―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">All of them fit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Every negative emotion a human can feel has become one lump, and it's devouring my heart.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I'll probably be caught by the police.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There were that many witnesses. And my looks stand out this much.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> will probably conclude it was me right away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If I go back to the Arata settlement, I'll probably end up causing trouble.</STYLE><PG>
Daddy<STYLE ID="3">―what was he trying to say to me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Was he going to hide me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Daddy<STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> would surely do that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But... but, </STYLE>Daddy<STYLE ID="3">...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That's a mistake, you know.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Because I know.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What kind of future waits when you hide someone who did something bad.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">God is watching, you know.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If you do something bad, you have to take your punishment properly.</STYLE><PG>
Daddy<STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> both did a bad thing, hiding a murderer, so I, their daughter, got punished too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It's not just me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There's </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that person</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> I met at the station too, and the people drenched in </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that person's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> blood―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">This is how God hands down punishment, cruel beyond measure.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">He drags in people who have nothing to do with it, and makes the ones who did wrong suffer all the more.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">On the phone just now, I hesitated over whether to tell him to get </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> away from Arata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But... if they run away again... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">what will happen?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">They'll surely just repeat the same thing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Run, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">and run, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">and run―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">and all that waits at the end of running―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">is a wretched ending.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It might get even worse than now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">So―</STYLE>Daddy<STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, let's give up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If you did something bad, let's take the punishment properly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That's the rule of society, isn't it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even a middle schooler knows that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And you'd still say 'one for all, all for one'?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Then paying for the crime now is the best thing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Miss this chance and it'll get even more wretched.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So I don't intend to stop </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Hurry to Arata and catch the bad people, please.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The bad people... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">don't let them become any worse, please.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But... I'm different.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I didn't kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that person</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> meaning to kill.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I just couldn't hold back and killed her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I just followed my own desire.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So... I'm not at fault, am I?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">This is the curse of the green eyes, isn't it?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">So... I'm different.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Killing without meaning to is far more terrifying than killing on purpose.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So, I'm different.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Not atoning for a crime... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">My very existence... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">is the sin.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It's not something that can be atoned for.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So I need a different punishment.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">In my hand, that knife.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Because I used this to slash </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that person</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> open, many people were cursed and died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Does this knife, having drunk that blood, still want blood?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">would my blood suit your taste?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'm a cursed girl, but―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">do you like the blood of a cursed daughter?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\夏菜ナイフ突き立て.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I put the point of the blade to my throat.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The point of the blade is colder than I thought.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">This April wind is cold too, after all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Blood has </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ぬ">soaked</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> my whole body, and the wind blowing on it steals away my warmth.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\電話ボックス1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The old phone booth flickers its light on and off, saying something.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Of course I can't make out a phone booth's voice, but what is it saying, I wonder.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Is it saying don't die, or is it saying die?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What am I even thinking?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">As if a phone booth could talk.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I must be lonely, all by myself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'm probably thinking things like how I'd like someone to be with me at the end, if I could.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But right now, regrets... I don't really have any.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Oh, but I'd have liked to at least thank </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, who looked after me to the very end.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\電話ボックス1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Did someone call me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I feel like someone called me in a loud voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Someone, from far away...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">No, that can't be.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Nobody here knows my name, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> won't call me by it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Is this how I'm trying to hold back the hand with the knife?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But... it's okay now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goodbye... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Daddy<STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Suddenly someone grabs my hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The knife I'd pressed to my throat won't move, held back by that strength.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\電話ボックス2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"So this is where you were."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\Code_of_Honor.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> pulls me into a tight embrace.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">As if to crush the lump of negative emotions trying to devour my heart.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Don't say anything. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">There's a lot I don't understand, but one thing I do: right now </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'re suffering enough to want to die."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Ise-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> clothes are getting stained with the spattered blood from mine.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even so, he won't loosen his grip.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm sorry. I shouldn't have left you alone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I... killed a lot of people..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Maybe so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But did </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> kill because you wanted to? Or were there circumstances you just couldn't avoid? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Depending on that, what happens to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> will change a lot."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I didn't... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">want... to kill..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then say so, with your head held high. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">And tell the world, loud and clear, why </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">'re suffering now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If you do, even the victims who survived this time might be able to recover."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Didn't they all die...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"There are a few women who were pulled away from the scene before they took fatal wounds. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But they're apparently still struggling, wanting to kill each other. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Isn't there a way to suppress their murderous intent?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I know one..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then we need </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> help."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> placed in my hand something a little familiar.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\携帯クリ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">It was the smartphone I'd borrowed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What I can do with this... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">by now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">is just one thing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">With this, everything ends.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">No... maybe everything can be reset and started over.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\携帯クリ入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
