<BR>
Daddy's<STYLE ID="3"> voice is desperate, but somewhere in it I feel kindness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">But to that voice I have to deliver a cold-blooded decision.</STYLE>
